[7.658506, "o", "\r\n\r\n"]
[11.064298, "o", "I'll coordinate our team to create your campaign for the EcoFlow smart water bottle. Here's my plan:\r\n\r\n1. **Brand Strategist** will research the market, competitors, and target audience (health-conscious millennials).\r\n2. **Copywriter** will create 3 Instagram posts using those insights, ensuring caption 3 is a single short sentence with no CTA or hashtags.\r\n3. **Designer** will generate image concepts for each post.\r\n4. **Critic** will review all creative work for quality.\r\n5. **Project Manager** will create the project timeline and deliverables.\r\n\r\nLet's begin with the market research!\r\n\r\n"]
[45.699194, "o", "✓ Research complete. I received insights on the \"Longevity Hacker\" audience, competitors like LARQ and HidrateSpark, and trends like \"Quiet Tech\" and \"Nervous System Regulation.\"\r\n\r\nNow moving to copywriting. I've instructed the copywriter to create three distinct posts, ensuring the third caption follows your specific \"single short sentence\" constraint.\r\n\r\n"]
[66.855719, "o", "✓ Copywriting complete. I received three captions, including the specific minimalist version for the third post."]
[66.85628, "o", "\r\n\r\nNow moving to visual design. I'm directing the designer to create three distinct images: a high-performance \"biohacker\" shot, a calm \"quiet tech\" workspace scene, and a minimalist product-focused aesthetic for the final post.\r\n\r\n"]
