[235.086524, "o", "*   **Issue:** The Critic noted that Caption 3 is missing a Call to Action (CTA) and hashtags, which are usually required for platform optimization.\r\n*   **Note:** I recognize that you specifically requested Caption 3 to be a single short sentence with no CTA or hashtags. I will ensure we maintain your specific constraint while addressing the Critic's feedback for the other posts.\r\n\r\n**Visuals: Score 7/10 - APPROVED ✓**\r\n*   **Status:** The visuals were approved, though the Critic noted some minor AI artifacts that could be polished.\r\n\r\nI'll work with the Copywriter to refine the posts. I will instruct them to keep Caption 3 exactly as you requested while strengthening the first two captions to improve the overall score.\r\n\r\n**Revision round 1 of 2**\r\n\r\n"]
